  "prefLabel": "Env-C 502.01 Applicant",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-C 502.01 “Applicant” means the licensed engineering firm that is seeking to be listed on the roster or to have an existing listing renewed.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-C 500) #10644, eff 7-22-14; ss by #14060, eff 8-21-24",
